<title>USA: Transamerica Corp completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Transamerica Corp completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transamerica Corp said Thursday it has completed its previously announced acquisition of Trans Ocean Ltd, a closely held container leasing company, for roughly 1.57 million shares of Transamerica common stock.</p>
<p>An agreement was originally announced on July 25.</p>
